      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "RAY COOKE AUCTIONEERS proudly present this superb two-bedroom, two-bathroom fourth-floor apartment to the market at No. 47 Burnell Square. Ideally positioned within this highly sought-after development just off the Malahide Road, this bright and spacious apartment offers well-proportioned accommodation throughout, excellent resident facilities, lift access and a superb location.\n\nExtending to approximately c. 66sqm, the accommodation briefly comprises a welcoming entrance hallway, spacious double bedroom with built-in wardrobes, generous second double bedroom complete with built-in wardrobes and ensuite, useful storage room off the hallway, fully tiled family bathroom and a modern open-plan kitchen and living area. The living room opens directly onto a superb private balcony, providing a fantastic outdoor area and the ideal setting to enjoy the evening sun.\n\nThe apartment is further enhanced by electric heating throughout, double glazing, and excellent storage. Residents of Burnell Square also benefit from lift access, secure parking and excellent communal facilities.\n\nThe location is exceptionally well connected, with bus stops located directly outside the development providing regular services to Dublin City Centre and surrounding areas. The Malahide Road offers easy access to a wealth of shopping, dining and recreational amenities, with Clarehall Shopping Centre, Tesco, Meadows & Byrne and a wide variety of cafés, restaurants and local services all within easy reach. Donaghmede Shopping Centre and Northside Shopping Centre are also nearby. For commuters, there is excellent access to the M50 and M1 motorways, while Dublin Airport is only a short drive away. Clongriffin DART Station is also within easy reach, providing direct rail services towards Dublin City Centre and beyond. The surrounding area benefits from an excellent choice of schools, parks, sports clubs and recreational amenities, while the coastal amenities of Malahide, Portmarnock and Howth are all within convenient travelling distance.\n\nViewing is highly recommended. Contact Ray Cooke Auctioneers today on 015411455 or 0861985247 to arrange a viewing or for further information.\n\nFeatures\n• c. 66 sq.m\n• BER C2\n• Management fees approximately 2,215\n• Fourth-floor apartment\n• 2 double bedrooms\n• 2 bathrooms\n• Master bedroom with built-in wardrobes\n• Ensuite bathroom\n• Second bedroom with built-in wardrobes\n• Private balcony\n• Open-plan kitchen and living area\n• Modern fitted kitchen\n• Storage room off hallway\n• Fully tiled family bathroom\n• Electric heating throughout\n• Lift access\n• Designated car parking space\n• Bike storage\n• Double glazed windows\n• Bus stops directly outside the development\n• Excellent public transport links\n• Convenient to Clongriffin DART Station\n• Easy access to M1 and M50 motorways\n• Dublin Airport within easy reach\n• Clarehall Shopping Centre nearby\n• Tesco and Meadows and Byrne within easy reach\n• Close to a wide selection of shops, cafés and restaurants\n• Excellent choice of schools and recreational amenities nearby\n• Convenient to Malahide, Portmarnock and Howth\n• Ideal for first-time buyers, owner occupiers, downsizers and investors\n• Early viewing highly advised"
      },
